{"version":1,"content":"<p>羅毓儀（Yuki）加入無綫處境劇《愛•回家之三代同糖》，並擔當長駐角色「招積琪」，Yuki她多謝公司畀機會，預告角色將會玩不同造型，務求帶出漂亮視覺，還會跟劇中男朋友不斷派糖，她笑指男友林俊其有點呷醋：「他陪我對劇本，知道劇情甜蜜，他好心痛，要求我送模型和包包安撫他。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:42:16.936020+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:04:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:21.658490+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:38:18.825502+00:00","content_hash":"20a8b6e74930fcf3c70a0a14a3ccb1fa995b79278f63e63e7286637a6a225e45","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}